WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 33

01:27.800 --> 01:30.050
(Tiande Hall)

01:30.050 --> 01:31.520
Everyone,

01:31.540 --> 01:33.810
is there anything else to report?

01:34.570 --> 01:36.010
Your Majesty,

01:36.130 --> 01:39.090
I, Zhen Heng, have a matter to report.

01:51.260 --> 01:52.180
Prince Yan...

01:52.180 --> 01:53.930
Since there is nothing else,

01:53.970 --> 01:55.420
let's dismiss the court.

01:56.650 --> 01:59.130
The court is dismissed.

01:59.330 --> 02:02.220
I take my leave.

02:11.740 --> 02:13.180
Mr. Zhen.

02:14.210 --> 02:15.650
You may leave.

02:24.370 --> 02:26.340
I take my leave.

02:36.900 --> 02:38.160
Your Majesty,

02:38.180 --> 02:39.440
if he keeps kneeling like this,

02:39.460 --> 02:41.500
how will he get married?

02:41.650 --> 02:43.440
Even if I let him go,

02:43.460 --> 02:45.250
he won't agree to it.

02:46.140 --> 02:48.620
Doesn't he want to die?

02:48.860 --> 02:52.070
Fine, let him be.

02:52.090 --> 02:54.070
Let him kneel for a few more days.

02:54.090 --> 02:55.650
Once the time comes,

02:55.770 --> 02:57.570
send him straight to the wedding.

03:09.650 --> 03:10.580
Jin, I understand

03:10.580 --> 03:12.090
your thoughts,

03:15.050 --> 03:17.120
but an imperial edict cannot be defied.

03:54.740 --> 03:57.900
Miss, Miss Chuchu is here.

03:59.620 --> 04:01.300
One is starving in the Palace;

04:01.300 --> 04:02.970
the other is starving here.

04:03.140 --> 04:04.190
Isn't that exactly

04:04.210 --> 04:06.020
what Cui Mingyue wants?

04:09.930 --> 04:11.670
Come on, eat something.

04:11.690 --> 04:13.110
Chuchu,

04:13.130 --> 04:15.030
is there truly no one in the Palace

04:15.780 --> 04:18.260
who can help him?

04:19.100 --> 04:20.900
What should I do?

04:21.490 --> 04:23.050
What should I do?

04:29.920 --> 04:32.000
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

04:32.010 --> 04:32.860
Your Grace,

04:32.860 --> 04:35.490
this is the wedding robe
from the Palace.

04:42.620 --> 04:44.720
Is this for the Princess Consort?

04:44.740 --> 04:45.790
Yes.

04:45.810 --> 04:48.200
So, Jiang Si's attire
is the same as mine?

04:48.220 --> 04:49.550
It should be.

04:49.570 --> 04:50.770
How could she deserve to wear

04:50.790 --> 04:53.470
(Dignified and Delicate)
the same wedding dress as me?

04:54.660 --> 04:55.710
Mother,

04:55.730 --> 04:57.010
at the blossom-viewing banquet,

04:57.010 --> 04:58.620
Jiang Si already imitated my outfit.

04:58.620 --> 04:59.540
On my wedding day,

04:59.540 --> 05:01.780
I cannot suffer such humiliation.

05:03.100 --> 05:04.250
Have the embroiderers

05:04.250 --> 05:06.290
alter this wedding robe.

05:06.540 --> 05:08.470
Use the jewels bestowed by His Majesty

05:08.490 --> 05:10.170
to decorate it further.

05:10.860 --> 05:12.300
Yes.

05:12.570 --> 05:14.970
Mother, you are the best.

05:15.370 --> 05:17.340
Are you happy now?

05:19.280 --> 05:22.480
(Zhuque Gate)

05:22.490 --> 05:23.070
Miss,

05:23.070 --> 05:24.210
Mr. Zhen said he'd inform us

05:24.220 --> 05:26.160
as soon as there is news.

05:26.180 --> 05:27.780
Let's go home and wait.

05:30.620 --> 05:34.090
It's fine. I'll wait here.

05:35.340 --> 05:41.460
♪ The world is changing;
may we find where we belong ♪

05:41.960 --> 05:48.540
♪ I want nothing else; I'll stop for you ♪

05:48.840 --> 05:55.050
♪ I'll give up everything ♪

05:56.060 --> 06:01.700
♪ To write to you,
a few words make a book ♪

06:02.960 --> 06:08.720
♪ Mottled fate reaches the end ♪

06:08.780 --> 06:10.470
There is no need to reconsider.

06:10.490 --> 06:12.700
This is my final answer.

06:13.570 --> 06:16.140
Giving all six flowers to one lady

06:16.340 --> 06:18.420
is something I wanted to do

06:18.420 --> 06:20.410
but I didn't dare.

06:22.590 --> 06:26.010
♪ Looking back, everything is ♪

06:26.020 --> 06:29.420
♪ Difficult to untangle ♪

06:29.480 --> 06:35.130
♪ All is to guard my love for you ♪

06:36.360 --> 06:39.850
♪ Morning mist’s reduced to dew ♪

06:39.850 --> 06:43.200
♪ The sun rises as usual ♪

06:43.220 --> 06:49.300
♪ In this lifetime,
I only want to be with you ♪

07:04.660 --> 07:09.780
♪ To write to you,
a few words make a book ♪

07:09.780 --> 07:11.560
(Tiande Hall)

07:11.560 --> 07:17.320
♪ Mottled fate reaches the end ♪

07:17.990 --> 07:24.370
♪ Hope to embrace eternity with you ♪

07:24.390 --> 07:31.000
♪ As if in a dream,
petals fall on the paper ♪

07:31.190 --> 07:34.610
♪ Looking back, everything is ♪

07:34.620 --> 07:38.130
♪ The sun rises as usual ♪

07:44.890 --> 07:47.260
Jin, have some water.

07:47.450 --> 07:49.900
No.

07:50.340 --> 07:51.180
I asked Mother

07:51.180 --> 07:52.790
to plead with Father,

07:52.810 --> 07:54.780
but he refused.

07:55.370 --> 07:58.290
I already guessed as much.

08:21.290 --> 08:23.180
In the blink of an eye,

08:23.290 --> 08:25.970
Princess Mingyue is about to marry.

08:26.980 --> 08:29.230
Two hairpins on one head?

08:29.250 --> 08:31.010
Isn't that too much?

08:34.490 --> 08:36.150
Then I'll wear just one.

08:36.170 --> 08:37.630
Mother, don't worry.

08:37.650 --> 08:39.170
Let Jiang Si

08:39.170 --> 08:40.680
enjoy her moment for now.

08:40.700 --> 08:41.770
After the wedding,

08:41.770 --> 08:42.940
under the same roof,

08:42.940 --> 08:44.820
I'll make sure to get rid of her.

08:45.620 --> 08:46.800
Is Jiang Si

08:46.820 --> 08:49.040
that easy to deal with?

08:49.060 --> 08:51.840
Mother, you overestimate her.

08:51.860 --> 08:52.960
Look.

08:52.980 --> 08:54.750
Once Uncle's decree is issued,

08:54.770 --> 08:56.820
won't she have to obey?

08:57.130 --> 08:59.230
After the wedding,

08:59.250 --> 09:00.290
I don't believe

09:00.310 --> 09:02.390
that Yu Jin will protect her every day.

09:02.410 --> 09:05.340
You are too naive.

09:10.130 --> 09:11.570
Mr. Zhen.

09:11.740 --> 09:13.220
Mr. Zhen.

09:13.490 --> 09:14.800
Miss Jiang,

09:14.820 --> 09:16.460
you look a bit weary.

09:16.880 --> 09:18.720
Please take care of yourself.

09:21.320 --> 09:23.080
Even I did not expect

09:23.280 --> 09:24.540
that Prince Yan

09:24.560 --> 09:26.260
would risk his life to defy the edict.

09:26.280 --> 09:27.840
His devotion is unwavering.

09:28.960 --> 09:30.860
Miss Jiang, your heart remains

09:30.880 --> 09:32.880
with him even outside the Palace.

09:33.160 --> 09:34.280
Through trials and hardships,

09:34.280 --> 09:35.660
you stand by his side.

09:35.680 --> 09:38.200
I truly admire you.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.120
Miss Jiang,

09:42.640 --> 09:44.680
even these towering walls

09:45.000 --> 09:47.060
can't keep apart

09:47.080 --> 09:48.800
your love for each other.

09:53.480 --> 09:54.920
Take care.

10:08.560 --> 10:10.960
Jin's condition is very bad.

10:11.120 --> 10:12.700
I've tried many ways,

10:12.720 --> 10:15.180
but I don't know
how to help him and Miss Jiang.

10:15.760 --> 10:16.760
Mr. Zhen,

10:16.760 --> 10:18.500
you are their close friend,

10:18.520 --> 10:20.160
so you must understand them.

10:20.760 --> 10:22.400
Do you have any way

10:22.400 --> 10:23.740
to help them

10:23.760 --> 10:25.280
meet each other?

10:32.880 --> 10:34.320
Your Highness,

10:34.640 --> 10:37.640
how about using a kite?

10:37.720 --> 10:39.200
A kite?

10:44.360 --> 10:45.380
Miss Jiang.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.460
Ms. Hua.

10:46.480 --> 10:48.340
The Empress has sent me to escort you

10:48.360 --> 10:50.280
to the Imperial Garden for a stroll.

10:52.560 --> 10:54.000
Alright.

10:54.480 --> 10:55.860
Help Miss Jiang.

10:55.880 --> 10:57.360
I'll stay here.

11:16.800 --> 11:17.640
Your Highness.

11:17.640 --> 11:19.800
Greetings, Your Highness.

11:20.880 --> 11:22.400
Miss Jiang, you may not know

11:22.400 --> 11:24.840
why I summoned you here.

11:27.640 --> 11:29.080
Come here.

11:30.480 --> 11:34.120
Though the Imperial Garden
is in the inner Palace,

11:34.520 --> 11:36.540
it is just one wall away

11:36.560 --> 11:38.480
from the Tiande Hall.

11:39.280 --> 11:41.720
This is the closest you can get to him.

11:46.160 --> 11:47.680
Thank you, Your Highness.

12:13.240 --> 12:14.240
Jin,

12:14.240 --> 12:16.180
you've been kneeling for three days.

12:16.200 --> 12:17.940
Father hasn't relented in the slightest.

12:17.960 --> 12:19.800
Are you going to keep kneeling?

12:20.080 --> 12:21.460
Yes.

12:21.480 --> 12:22.400
If you keep kneeling,

12:22.400 --> 12:24.320
your body will collapse.

12:28.600 --> 12:29.480
Have you forgotten

12:29.480 --> 12:31.240
who you are?

12:31.360 --> 12:33.160
If I can't even control my son,

12:33.160 --> 12:34.380
how can I rule my country?

12:34.400 --> 12:35.700
(Father, )

12:35.720 --> 12:38.060
(I have never forgotten who I am.)

12:38.080 --> 12:39.160
(I also understand)

12:39.160 --> 12:40.320
(that as Emperor, )

12:40.320 --> 12:41.680
(you cannot take back your edict.)

12:41.680 --> 12:44.180
(But I only love Jiang Si.)

12:44.200 --> 12:45.640
Jin,

12:46.480 --> 12:48.120
do you miss Miss Jiang?

12:52.600 --> 12:54.040
Of course.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.520
Jin, look.

13:01.680 --> 13:03.120
Look over there.

13:05.280 --> 13:06.620
Miss Jiang is right there.

13:06.640 --> 13:08.380
She's been with you all along.

13:24.160 --> 13:25.890
♪ From place to place ♪

13:25.890 --> 13:30.830
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

13:31.200 --> 13:33.100
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

13:33.120 --> 13:35.720
I know that after I become Prince Yan,

13:36.200 --> 13:38.640
the road ahead will be even harder.

13:38.680 --> 13:40.840
I don't deserve what you want,

13:41.000 --> 13:43.440
a small courtyard, a plot of land.

13:43.480 --> 13:45.060
But I have made up my mind.

13:45.080 --> 13:46.200
This life, I'll cling to you.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.920
You can't drive me away.

13:48.640 --> 13:52.000
I was born and raised in Dazhou.

13:52.080 --> 13:53.880
How could I not love it?

13:54.760 --> 13:56.680
But I like

13:57.760 --> 14:00.000
living with you even more.

14:02.530 --> 14:04.310
♪ Time glows ♪

14:04.310 --> 14:08.770
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

14:08.790 --> 14:12.400
♪ And stars ♪

14:14.240 --> 14:15.720
Take a look! Sugar figures!

14:15.720 --> 14:17.320
- Mother.
- Pick one yourself.

14:17.320 --> 14:19.280
I want a sugar figure.

14:21.400 --> 14:22.500
Which one do you want?

14:22.520 --> 14:24.160
Alright, choose one.

14:24.160 --> 14:26.020
- Which one?
- I want the little rabbit.

14:26.040 --> 14:27.260
The little rabbit.

14:27.280 --> 14:28.380
Sir, how much?

14:28.400 --> 14:29.420
Two wen.

14:29.440 --> 14:30.880
Alright.

14:33.680 --> 14:34.780
Thank you, Ma'am.

14:34.800 --> 14:36.240
Thank you.

14:39.120 --> 14:40.600
Father.

14:48.800 --> 14:50.400
Mother,

14:50.760 --> 14:53.360
is that Father?

14:53.400 --> 14:55.560
Yan, you're mistaken.

14:55.760 --> 14:57.360
That is not your father.

14:57.640 --> 14:59.080
Let's go home.

15:12.160 --> 15:14.080
(Morning Drizzle)

15:14.080 --> 15:15.120
Hold on tight, Yan.

15:15.120 --> 15:16.560
Sure.

15:23.280 --> 15:24.720
Mother,

15:25.200 --> 15:27.320
was that man I just saw

15:27.400 --> 15:29.200
my father?

15:30.800 --> 15:31.940
No.

15:31.960 --> 15:33.560
He's just a madman.

16:51.200 --> 16:53.260
Thank you, Ma'am. Thank you.

16:53.280 --> 16:54.720
Zhu Ziyu.

17:01.320 --> 17:04.120
It's not me. You have the wrong man.

17:09.960 --> 17:11.920
How did you end up like this?

17:20.080 --> 17:22.200
Not long after our divorce,

17:23.680 --> 17:26.000
my family was confiscated and exiled.

17:26.200 --> 17:28.400
On the way, the Grand Princess

17:28.640 --> 17:31.440
sent people to silence us.

17:32.400 --> 17:35.320
83 people of my family

17:36.600 --> 17:39.440
were slaughtered on the road.

17:41.080 --> 17:42.240
I was the only one

17:42.240 --> 17:44.200
who survived.

17:54.600 --> 17:57.560
You should never have trusted
Cui Mingyue.

17:58.120 --> 18:00.040
Day and night,

18:02.120 --> 18:04.920
I have been tormented by guilt,
wishing for death.

18:05.320 --> 18:06.920
But I know

18:06.960 --> 18:09.360
I do not deserve release.

18:09.920 --> 18:12.600
I must suffer through regret

18:14.440 --> 18:15.880
to atone for my sins.

18:21.160 --> 18:23.160
Those two have always been ruthless.

18:24.840 --> 18:26.720
You were not their only victim.

18:27.720 --> 18:29.360
My mother was also killed

18:31.720 --> 18:33.960
by the Grand Princess.

18:35.080 --> 18:38.120
And now they want to ruin Si's marriage.

18:38.520 --> 18:41.600
Cui Mingyue destroyed your family,

18:42.600 --> 18:45.360
and now she'll become Princess Yan.

18:46.040 --> 18:48.800
They are so cruel and heartless.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.000
Must we rely on heaven

18:51.000 --> 18:52.560
to punish them?

18:53.680 --> 18:55.120
Azhu.

18:57.840 --> 18:59.600
Take this money.

19:00.160 --> 19:01.600
I can't accept it.

19:02.400 --> 19:03.840
Take it.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.880
Buy yourself a meal,

19:06.120 --> 19:08.200
and get some clean clothes.

19:09.040 --> 19:11.080
Though we are divorced,

19:12.040 --> 19:14.200
you are still Yan's father.

19:15.040 --> 19:17.340
I won't stop you
from seeing your daughter.

19:18.710 --> 19:19.560
I don't want Yan

19:19.560 --> 19:21.360
to see her father

19:21.520 --> 19:23.360
like this.

19:28.800 --> 19:30.840
I have known you for so many years.

19:31.520 --> 19:33.600
I don't believe you are a bad man.

19:45.800 --> 19:50.920
(Fuchun Teahouse)

20:25.950 --> 20:29.500
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

20:29.520 --> 20:32.900
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

20:33.170 --> 20:39.140
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

20:40.300 --> 20:43.930
♪ East wind unfair ♪

20:43.950 --> 20:47.460
♪ Happy times rare ♪

20:47.480 --> 20:50.970
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

20:50.990 --> 20:54.500
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

20:54.520 --> 21:00.580
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

21:10.320 --> 21:11.280
Miss Jiang.

21:11.280 --> 21:12.720
Miss.

21:14.120 --> 21:15.420
Your Highness.

21:15.440 --> 21:17.460
Jin has collapsed in front of the hall,

21:17.480 --> 21:19.420
but Father has shown no mercy.

21:19.440 --> 21:20.440
If this continues,

21:20.440 --> 21:22.040
I fear Jin's health...

21:22.080 --> 21:23.520
Miss Jiang,

21:24.160 --> 21:25.600
are you alright?

21:25.720 --> 21:26.960
It seems that Father

21:26.960 --> 21:28.680
has made up his mind this time.

21:28.760 --> 21:29.680
My eyes

21:29.680 --> 21:30.680
were cured

21:30.680 --> 21:32.020
because of you and Jin.

21:32.040 --> 21:34.640
I don't want to see either of you
come to harm.

21:35.320 --> 21:37.340
Jin always listens to you.

21:37.360 --> 21:38.320
Perhaps now,

21:38.320 --> 21:40.320
only you can save him.

21:41.720 --> 21:43.360
I want you to be my wife

21:44.000 --> 21:45.840
and be with you forever.

21:46.280 --> 21:47.960
Everyone I care about

21:49.720 --> 21:51.760
has died tragically.

21:55.360 --> 21:57.080
I'm afraid you will too.

22:01.560 --> 22:03.000
Aman,

22:03.720 --> 22:06.120
do you think I am truly a jinx?

22:06.760 --> 22:09.000
He could once ride freely

22:09.280 --> 22:10.840
and live a carefree life,

22:12.040 --> 22:14.040
but now, because of me,

22:14.520 --> 22:16.680
he almost died in front of the hall.

22:16.720 --> 22:19.240
I don't want to share my husband,

22:19.880 --> 22:21.460
but how can my grievances

22:21.480 --> 22:24.240
compare to his life?

22:24.680 --> 22:26.340
I don't understand anything,

22:26.520 --> 22:28.100
but I can tell

22:28.120 --> 22:29.960
that Prince Yan

22:29.960 --> 22:30.880
values your grievances

22:30.880 --> 22:32.320
more than his life.

22:33.760 --> 22:35.280
Of course, I know that.

22:35.600 --> 22:37.040
So,

22:37.800 --> 22:39.800
I can't let anything happen to him.

22:41.520 --> 22:42.580
Your Highness,

22:42.600 --> 22:44.620
could you please think of a way

22:44.640 --> 22:46.560
to bring me to His Majesty?

22:51.480 --> 22:52.780
It's bad.

22:52.800 --> 22:54.220
It's bad, Your Majesty.

22:54.240 --> 22:55.200
It's bad.

22:55.200 --> 22:57.180
What's the rush? Speak.

22:57.200 --> 22:59.240
The 7th Prince...

22:59.240 --> 23:00.160
What's wrong with Jin?

23:00.160 --> 23:01.600
The 7th Prince

23:02.000 --> 23:03.880
has fainted.

23:03.960 --> 23:05.140
Your Majesty,

23:05.160 --> 23:06.220
please let someone

23:06.240 --> 23:07.440
take Jin back to his room

23:07.440 --> 23:09.000
to rest.

23:09.080 --> 23:09.960
If he can't understand

23:09.960 --> 23:11.400
my intention,

23:11.960 --> 23:13.940
he'll certainly repeat the mistake.

23:13.960 --> 23:16.780
If he makes an even greater mistake

23:16.800 --> 23:18.560
that even I can't protect him,

23:18.960 --> 23:20.540
what should he do then?

23:20.560 --> 23:22.000
Report.

23:22.120 --> 23:23.000
Your Majesty,

23:23.000 --> 23:25.520
Miss Jiang Si requests an audience.

23:27.840 --> 23:29.280
Summon her in.

24:00.880 --> 24:01.760
(Haitang Chamber)

24:01.760 --> 24:03.200
Miss.

24:03.280 --> 24:04.720
Miss.

24:05.040 --> 24:06.260
What's wrong? Why so panic?

24:06.280 --> 24:07.600
Have you packed up the things

24:07.600 --> 24:08.900
for Si?

24:08.920 --> 24:11.840
Miss, Zhu Ziyu is here.

24:16.880 --> 24:18.180
Let him in.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.640
Yes.

24:39.240 --> 24:40.680
Yi.

24:49.920 --> 24:51.400
Why are you here?

25:02.520 --> 25:04.680
- Yu Jin, Yu Jin.
- Jin.

25:04.680 --> 25:06.140
- Yu Jin, wake up.
- Jin.

25:06.160 --> 25:07.580
Fuqing, water.

25:07.600 --> 25:09.040
Yu Jin.

25:10.520 --> 25:11.860
Yu Jin.

25:11.880 --> 25:13.520
Yu Jin, wake up.

25:17.280 --> 25:18.200
Miss Jiang has already

25:18.200 --> 25:20.240
agreed to the marriage.

25:21.600 --> 25:22.560
Come on.

25:22.560 --> 25:24.000
Come on, Fuqing.

25:25.680 --> 25:27.440
I don't believe it.

25:29.480 --> 25:31.680
Why would I lie to you?

25:31.880 --> 25:34.180
Miss Jiang went
to meet with His Majesty.

25:34.200 --> 25:36.480
She said she'd share her husband
with Princess Mingyue

25:36.500 --> 25:37.540
and only wanted His Majesty

25:37.540 --> 25:39.500
to forgive you for trespassing
into the Palace.

25:39.520 --> 25:41.080
I refuse.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.780
I refuse.

25:42.800 --> 25:44.240
Yu Jin,

25:44.360 --> 25:45.580
I know

25:45.600 --> 25:46.840
you'd risk your life

25:46.840 --> 25:48.480
for Miss Jiang,

25:48.480 --> 25:49.860
but you've forgotten

25:49.880 --> 25:51.420
you are ultimately a Prince.

25:51.440 --> 25:53.440
Even if His Majesty is furious with you,

25:53.440 --> 25:55.100
he doesn't truly want to kill you.

25:55.120 --> 25:56.540
What about Miss Jiang?

25:56.560 --> 25:58.580
If she

25:58.600 --> 26:00.280
and her family

26:00.300 --> 26:01.520
angered His Majesty over this,

26:01.520 --> 26:03.920
the consequences would be unimaginable.

26:12.040 --> 26:17.560
(Haitang Chamber)

26:32.280 --> 26:33.980
(Now, the only way to break the deadlock)

26:34.000 --> 26:36.200
(is with the evidence
in Zhu Ziyu's hands.)

26:36.320 --> 26:38.680
(Everything depends on his actions today.)

26:38.960 --> 26:41.320
(I hope things go as planned.)

26:49.240 --> 26:51.220
Prince Yan, the time has come.

26:51.240 --> 26:52.780
You should dress up now.

26:53.680 --> 26:55.120
Your Highness?

27:43.760 --> 27:46.140
(My daughter is 16 now.)

27:46.160 --> 27:48.660
(You're pretty and graceful, )

27:48.680 --> 27:50.380
(elegant and refined.)

27:50.400 --> 27:53.200
(Today, you are getting married.)

27:53.440 --> 27:56.100
(May your life be smooth and safe, )

27:56.120 --> 27:57.960
(full of happiness.)

28:13.400 --> 28:14.840
Mother,

28:17.680 --> 28:19.760
I've always wanted to know

28:20.080 --> 28:22.000
what it feels like to have a home.

28:24.040 --> 28:25.480
Today,

28:25.880 --> 28:28.240
I will finally have my home.

28:31.760 --> 28:33.280
Once married,

28:34.080 --> 28:36.080
you can no longer be headstrong.

28:36.520 --> 28:38.360
I can't always

28:38.360 --> 28:40.240
be by your side, guiding you.

28:41.280 --> 28:43.040
Whatever you do,

28:43.200 --> 28:45.560
you must think carefully.

29:04.160 --> 29:05.600
Mother,

29:08.200 --> 29:10.360
I am getting married today.

29:11.280 --> 29:12.720
In the future,

29:13.440 --> 29:16.200
I won't be able to serve you.

29:17.200 --> 29:22.040
I hope you'll be safe and healthy,

29:22.200 --> 29:23.840
and all things will go well.

29:55.200 --> 29:57.680
(Wedding Joy)

29:57.680 --> 30:00.680
(Double Happiness)

30:20.080 --> 30:22.560
(Wedding Joy)

30:22.560 --> 30:26.560
(Double Happiness)

30:57.480 --> 30:58.400
Your Grace,

30:58.400 --> 31:00.700
Prince Yan is waiting for you ahead.

31:00.720 --> 31:02.160
We'll arrive soon.

31:06.040 --> 31:07.700
Look, that's Prince Yan.

31:07.720 --> 31:09.260
Prince Yan is so handsome.

31:09.280 --> 31:10.620
And so young.

31:10.640 --> 31:12.500
Princess Yan is truly fortunate.

31:12.520 --> 31:13.960
Yes.

32:01.040 --> 32:02.480
Your Highness.

32:08.600 --> 32:12.120
I, Yu Jin, as the 7th Prince,

32:12.140 --> 32:14.200
trespassed into the Palace,
which is unforgivable.

32:14.200 --> 32:15.050
Your Highness...

32:15.050 --> 32:17.000
Today, I voluntarily renounce

32:17.000 --> 32:18.740
my position as the 7th Prince.

32:19.600 --> 32:21.820
Eunuch Liu, please ask the Emperor

32:21.840 --> 32:23.620
to strip me of my title.

32:23.640 --> 32:27.000
Your Highness, you can't say that.

32:37.880 --> 32:39.400
I have made up my mind.

32:40.280 --> 32:42.700
It is because of my identity
as the 7th Prince

32:43.000 --> 32:45.600
that I must do things against my will.

32:45.680 --> 32:46.560
If this continues,

32:46.560 --> 32:49.000
I will only hurt the one I love.

32:49.120 --> 32:50.560
I don't want to give

32:50.760 --> 32:52.000
this kind of love.

32:52.000 --> 32:53.440
Your Highness!

32:55.960 --> 32:57.340
Your Highness,

32:57.340 --> 32:59.720
you can't just leave like this.

32:59.840 --> 33:03.000
How should I explain it to the Emperor?

33:03.000 --> 33:04.440
Yu Jin.

33:05.560 --> 33:06.900
What do you take me for?

33:06.920 --> 33:08.200
This marriage was granted

33:08.200 --> 33:09.160
by the Emperor.

33:09.160 --> 33:10.640
We're engaged.

33:10.640 --> 33:12.640
It's us who're engaged.

33:14.680 --> 33:16.240
Who is this?

33:17.680 --> 33:19.500
Who is this man?

33:19.520 --> 33:20.960
Yes.

33:21.040 --> 33:22.080
How could he be engaged

33:22.080 --> 33:23.600
to Princess Mingyue?

33:28.870 --> 33:30.230
That's right.

33:30.460 --> 33:31.360
What's going on?

33:31.360 --> 33:33.480
He's engaged to Princess Mingyue?

33:35.760 --> 33:37.200
Princess Mingyue.

33:40.040 --> 33:41.720
Princess Mingyue and I are in love

33:41.720 --> 33:43.460
and have long been secretly engaged.

33:43.480 --> 33:45.100
Even if the Emperor has an edict,

33:45.120 --> 33:46.660
he should not take another man's wife.

33:46.680 --> 33:48.120
Who are you?

33:48.560 --> 33:50.300
The Princess promised me

33:50.320 --> 33:51.580
that if I divorced my wife,

33:51.600 --> 33:53.080
she'd marry me.

33:53.240 --> 33:55.040
If she breaks her word,

33:55.480 --> 33:57.100
she deserves to be punished by cuts.

33:57.120 --> 33:58.140
Is this true?

33:58.160 --> 33:59.600
Absolutely true.

34:00.300 --> 34:01.480
I have the Letter of Marriage

34:01.480 --> 34:02.780
handwritten by Princess Mingyue.

34:02.780 --> 34:03.800
How shameless.

34:03.800 --> 34:05.280
- I'm a Commandery Princess.
- Hurry.

34:05.280 --> 34:06.860
- How could we be engaged?
- Go report.

34:06.860 --> 34:08.380
Don't think you can ruin my marriage

34:08.380 --> 34:09.240
and destroy my future

34:09.240 --> 34:10.200
with a few mad words.

34:10.200 --> 34:11.800
Someone, take him away.

34:11.800 --> 34:13.400
Kill him!

34:13.520 --> 34:15.360
She wants to kill him?

34:27.120 --> 34:29.540
Your Highness, this is what's happened.

34:29.560 --> 34:32.000
Please save Princess Mingyue.

34:32.360 --> 34:34.440
There's even a contract?

34:35.720 --> 34:37.420
Why wasn't this reported to me?

34:37.440 --> 34:38.820
It's my incompetence.

34:38.840 --> 34:40.660
I didn't investigate thoroughly.

34:40.760 --> 34:43.220
Jiang Si and Yu Jin

34:43.240 --> 34:45.680
have put on such a good show

34:46.760 --> 34:49.280
and deceived me.

35:09.000 --> 35:10.460
How shameless.

35:10.480 --> 35:11.680
I'm a Commandery Princess.

35:11.680 --> 35:13.460
How could I be secretly engaged to you?

35:13.480 --> 35:14.580
Someone,

35:14.600 --> 35:16.100
get him out.

35:16.120 --> 35:17.180
Kill him!

35:17.200 --> 35:18.700
Kill him!

35:18.720 --> 35:19.860
Stop it.

35:19.880 --> 35:21.780
Where do you think this is?

35:21.800 --> 35:23.220
This is the Tiande Hall.

35:23.240 --> 35:24.600
Do you want to kill him

35:24.600 --> 35:26.140
in front of me?

35:26.160 --> 35:27.160
Uncle,

35:27.160 --> 35:28.840
I've been humiliated and smeared

35:28.840 --> 35:29.900
in the street.

35:29.920 --> 35:32.260
You must stand up for me.

35:32.280 --> 35:34.440
Have you forgotten our oath?

35:34.720 --> 35:36.480
- Don't touch me.
- I am devoted to you.

35:36.500 --> 35:37.600
I divorced my wife for you.

35:37.600 --> 35:38.880
How could you treat me like this?

35:38.880 --> 35:41.880
Uncle, I don't even know him.

35:44.160 --> 35:45.400
It must be Jiang Si.

35:45.420 --> 35:47.140
Jiang Si was dissatisfied
with your decree

35:47.160 --> 35:48.000
and asked this man

35:48.000 --> 35:48.880
to smear me in public

35:48.880 --> 35:50.400
and ruin my reputation.

35:50.520 --> 35:51.960
Zhu Ziyu,

35:52.080 --> 35:53.780
do you know slandering

35:53.780 --> 35:55.180
a Commandery Princess is a felony?

35:55.200 --> 35:57.060
You're falsely accusing me.

35:57.080 --> 35:58.100
According to the law,

35:58.120 --> 36:00.120
he should be sliced slowly, right?

36:06.880 --> 36:08.320
Zhu Ziyu,

36:08.400 --> 36:09.840
let me ask you.

36:10.200 --> 36:11.760
Do you have evidence?

36:11.880 --> 36:13.320
Your Majesty,

36:13.520 --> 36:15.880
I am not without evidence.

36:19.280 --> 36:20.800
This contract was

36:21.040 --> 36:23.600
personally written by Princess Mingyue.

36:23.640 --> 36:25.080
I've already...

36:34.160 --> 36:35.600
Mingyue,

36:35.640 --> 36:37.920
did you write this contract?

36:37.920 --> 36:40.020
No, I didn't write it.

36:40.040 --> 36:41.120
How could I write

36:41.120 --> 36:42.220
such a contract?

36:42.240 --> 36:43.300
It wasn't me.

36:43.320 --> 36:44.760
Your Grace,

36:44.800 --> 36:46.400
sorry for disappointing you.

36:46.600 --> 36:48.540
The contract you burned

36:48.560 --> 36:50.000
was fake.

36:57.360 --> 37:00.040
How could I let you burn the real one?

37:00.760 --> 37:02.440
Every word, every sentence,

37:02.800 --> 37:05.000
is filled with your deep affection
for me.

37:05.080 --> 37:07.100
I'll treasure it for a lifetime.

37:07.120 --> 37:08.760
Is this contract true or not?

37:08.760 --> 37:10.060
It's not true.

37:10.080 --> 37:11.100
He's lying.

37:11.120 --> 37:12.260
I didn't write it.

37:12.280 --> 37:13.680
I didn't write it.

37:13.680 --> 37:14.800
He's lying, Uncle.

37:14.800 --> 37:15.760
Your Majesty,

37:15.760 --> 37:17.880
it's not difficult
to determine the authenticity

37:17.880 --> 37:19.320
of the contract.

37:19.520 --> 37:20.780
We just need Princess Mingyue

37:20.800 --> 37:22.400
to write a new one,

37:22.520 --> 37:25.280
and I will compare them.

37:29.200 --> 37:30.640
Alright.

37:33.640 --> 37:37.000
My name is Cui Mingyue,
with a courtesy name Yazhi,

37:37.080 --> 37:39.520
eldest daughter
of Grand Princess Rongyang.

37:39.600 --> 37:41.680
I was born three quarters
after the Chou hour

37:41.700 --> 37:44.100
on the 18th day of of the 5th month,
8th year of Jingming.

37:44.120 --> 37:47.440
I'm in love with Zhu Ziyu,
Gentleman-Confucian.

37:47.600 --> 37:50.080
However, he is already married.

37:50.160 --> 37:52.820
I should have cut off my feelings,

37:52.840 --> 37:54.940
but Zhu claims his wife, Jiang,

37:54.960 --> 37:58.960
has met one
of the Seven Criteria for Divorce,

37:59.080 --> 38:02.300
and he intends to divorce her
and remarry.

38:02.320 --> 38:05.280
So, I set this down in writing

38:05.440 --> 38:07.560
that the day Zhu divorces his wife

38:07.760 --> 38:10.680
will be the day I marry him.

38:10.680 --> 38:14.120
(will be the day I marry him)

38:25.160 --> 38:28.920
(Contract)

38:33.070 --> 38:35.720
Your Majesty, please take a look.

38:37.800 --> 38:39.240
Rongyang,

38:39.280 --> 38:40.380
take a look.

38:40.400 --> 38:43.060
Is the handwriting the same?

38:43.080 --> 38:46.280
(Signed by Cui Mingyue,
Grand Princess Rongyang's daughter)

38:54.360 --> 38:55.880
The handwriting

38:56.320 --> 38:58.400
does seem similar.

38:59.240 --> 39:00.300
Your Majesty,

39:00.320 --> 39:01.800
after my examination,

39:01.920 --> 39:03.740
the handwriting is identical.

39:03.760 --> 39:06.040
They were written by the same person.

39:06.040 --> 39:07.960
(Contract)

39:07.960 --> 39:09.220
Your Majesty,

39:09.240 --> 39:11.660
there are many people in the world

39:11.680 --> 39:13.100
who can imitate others' handwriting

39:13.100 --> 39:14.220
and pass off fakes as real.

39:14.240 --> 39:15.860
If this contract were genuine,

39:15.880 --> 39:18.060
why did Zhu Ziyu wait until now

39:18.080 --> 39:20.920
to stop the ceremony in public?

39:21.280 --> 39:22.660
You should ask him

39:22.680 --> 39:25.760
who is behind all of this.

39:27.840 --> 39:29.220
Your Majesty,

39:29.240 --> 39:31.660
I didn't deliberately wait until today.

39:31.680 --> 39:34.200
My father was the Household Manager
of Lingshui,

39:34.240 --> 39:36.700
but he was falsely accused
of accepting bribes.

39:36.760 --> 39:38.880
My entire family was exiled.

39:39.880 --> 39:41.480
On the way into exile,

39:41.840 --> 39:43.660
we were attacked by bandits.

39:43.680 --> 39:46.060
Of the 83 people in our family,

39:46.080 --> 39:48.000
I was the only one who survived.

39:48.000 --> 39:49.340
What does that

39:49.360 --> 39:51.820
have to do with the current situation?

39:51.840 --> 39:53.500
After escaping death,

39:53.520 --> 39:55.340
I was despairing,

39:55.360 --> 39:57.360
only wanting to follow my family.

39:58.160 --> 40:00.380
It was Princess Mingyue's promise

40:00.400 --> 40:02.360
that gave me the hope to keep living.

40:02.380 --> 40:03.700
I traveled a long way to Ling'an,

40:03.700 --> 40:05.880
only to find that Princess Mingyue
was about to marry.

40:05.880 --> 40:07.160
- I was...
- Nonsense!

40:07.180 --> 40:09.180
Your family's disaster happened
over a month ago.

40:09.180 --> 40:11.180
Why did you wait until now
to arrive in Ling'an?

40:11.200 --> 40:13.020
Stopping a Prince's wedding alone

40:13.040 --> 40:14.940
is enough to sentence you to death.

40:14.960 --> 40:16.060
Rongyang,

40:16.080 --> 40:17.560
how do you know

40:17.680 --> 40:20.280
that it happened over a month ago?

40:26.720 --> 40:28.160
Your Majesty,

40:28.920 --> 40:30.380
I only found out

40:30.400 --> 40:33.160
right before entering the Palace.

40:36.560 --> 40:37.670
Zhen Heng,

40:37.690 --> 40:38.570
how do you think

40:38.580 --> 40:40.420
this case should be handled?

40:40.440 --> 40:41.860
Your Majesty,

40:41.880 --> 40:43.520
this contract is genuine.

40:43.640 --> 40:45.160
According to the law,

40:45.720 --> 40:47.160
Princess Mingyue

40:47.200 --> 40:48.680
should honor her agreement

40:48.680 --> 40:50.200
and marry Mr. Zhu.

40:50.960 --> 40:52.960
I don't want to, Uncle.

40:53.440 --> 40:55.280
I have deep feelings
for Princess Mingyue.

40:55.280 --> 40:56.740
Your Majesty, please grant my wish.

40:56.760 --> 40:57.640
Uncle.

40:57.640 --> 40:59.440
Mother, I won't marry him.

41:00.040 --> 41:01.740
Rongyang, look.

41:01.760 --> 41:04.120
As the Emperor,

41:04.120 --> 41:06.660
I cannot go against the law.

41:06.680 --> 41:08.280
Moreover, keeping one's word

41:08.280 --> 41:10.480
is the imperial way.

41:10.800 --> 41:12.440
Since it is genuine,

41:13.040 --> 41:14.940
Mingyue must keep her promise

41:14.960 --> 41:16.720
and marry Zhu Ziyu.

41:17.920 --> 41:19.100
No, Mother.

41:19.120 --> 41:20.540
I don't want to.

41:20.560 --> 41:22.460
I don't want to marry Zhu Ziyu.

41:22.480 --> 41:23.920
I want to marry Yu Jin.

41:23.920 --> 41:25.360
Shut up.

41:25.400 --> 41:28.340
If I'd known you'd been secretly engaged
to another man,

41:28.360 --> 41:29.760
how could I have shamelessly asked

41:29.760 --> 41:31.680
the Emperor for a marriage edict?

41:31.840 --> 41:33.380
The sins you've brought upon yourself

41:33.400 --> 41:35.240
are yours to bear.

41:35.440 --> 41:38.840
The country has its laws;
the family has its rules.

41:39.280 --> 41:40.720
Baoping,

41:40.840 --> 41:42.560
I just remembered

41:42.760 --> 41:44.520
the auspicious time has been set.

41:44.520 --> 41:46.820
Can they still marry today?

41:46.840 --> 41:48.340
Your Majesty,

41:48.360 --> 41:49.900
the auspicious time is near.

41:49.920 --> 41:52.480
It'd be perfect to start
the wedding ceremony now.

41:52.480 --> 41:53.920
Alright.

41:54.120 --> 41:55.740
Bring them both here.

41:55.760 --> 41:57.800
Today, I will witness it myself.

41:57.840 --> 41:58.840
Let these two couples

41:58.840 --> 42:00.660
have their wedding ceremony
in the Palace.

42:00.680 --> 42:02.120
Mother...

42:02.280 --> 42:04.180
Mother, please beg Uncle.

42:04.200 --> 42:06.560
Uncle, I beg you.

42:06.600 --> 42:08.480
I don't want to marry Zhu Ziyu.

42:08.480 --> 42:09.620
Uncle.

42:09.640 --> 42:12.060
- Mother, speak.
- Congratulations, Your Highness.

42:12.080 --> 42:13.140
Your Highness,

42:13.160 --> 42:15.220
His Majesty has approved your marriage.

42:15.240 --> 42:16.380
Go in now.

42:16.400 --> 42:17.840
I won't go in.

42:18.480 --> 42:19.800
I'm content with standing here

42:19.800 --> 42:20.640
listening to that.

42:20.640 --> 42:22.080
Let's go.

42:32.720 --> 42:34.800
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

42:34.800 --> 42:36.020
Your Grace,

42:36.040 --> 42:37.280
go apologize

42:37.280 --> 42:38.920
to the Grand Princess.

42:39.960 --> 42:41.400
Mother,

42:41.480 --> 42:43.160
I'm sorry.

42:43.880 --> 42:46.060
I shouldn't have hidden
the contract from you,

42:46.080 --> 42:47.940
but I really have burned it.

42:47.960 --> 42:49.400
What use is there in saying this now?

42:49.400 --> 42:53.680
(The End of Episode 33)

42:54.170 --> 42:55.900
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.900 --> 43:00.840
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.210 --> 43:03.590
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.590 --> 43:07.820
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.530 --> 43:10.930
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.950 --> 43:14.610
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.630 --> 43:18.050
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.200 --> 43:23.720
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.540 --> 43:28.220
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.220 --> 43:32.300
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.540 --> 43:34.280
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.300 --> 43:39.000
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.000 --> 43:42.570
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.590 --> 43:46.820
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.840 --> 43:48.620
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.620 --> 43:53.160
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.180 --> 43:57.980
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.210 --> 44:04.740
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.760 --> 44:08.380
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.400 --> 44:11.830
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.850 --> 44:16.470
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.470 --> 44:20.160
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.180 --> 44:24.270
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.380 --> 44:26.200
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.200 --> 44:30.750
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.770 --> 44:34.470
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.490 --> 44:38.650
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.830 --> 44:40.590
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.590 --> 44:45.110
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.110 --> 44:48.750
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.770 --> 44:54.440
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.130 --> 44:58.060
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.060 --> 45:05.560
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
